{"repo": {"timestamp": 1795835446000, "version": 20002, "name": "A.O.Jarvis", "icon": "repo-icon.png", "address": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis/gh-pages/fdroid/repo", "description": "Reposit\u00f3rio F-Droid oficial do aplicativo A.O.Jarvis Android (Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis)."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"authorName": "A.O.Jarvis", "categories": ["System", "Internet"], "suggestedVersionName": "1.3.3", "suggestedVersionCode": "7", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0", "name": "A.O.Jarvis", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis", "added": 1795835353000, "icon": "com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx.7.png", "packageName": "com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx", "lastUpdated": 1795835441000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "A.O.Jarvis is a local-first Android personal voice assistant combining Gemini Cloud (via Firebase AI Logic), a local Ollama server over Wi-Fi, and offline voice commands.\n\nKey features:\n- Native Android SpeechRecognizer with offline support, lightweight \"Hey Jarvis\" AudioRecord wake-word detection, and customizable Text-to-Speech (TTS).\n- Persistent Foreground Service with wake-word standby, battery monitoring, and authenticated local Wi-Fi LAN triggers.\n- Seamless routing between Gemini Cloud, Gemini Live, and local Ollama over Wi-Fi.\n- Local Room database for voice command history, offline commands, memories, and multi-session conversations.\n- Remote update delivery via GitHub Releases and official F-Droid repository.\n", "icon": "icon_VIgUKn9poC4_iuwbCJrhqG6Cm7SeBo78BQMFe3sdGRw=.png", "name": "A.O.Jarvis", "summary": "Android voice assistant with Gemini, local Wi-Fi Ollama, and offline voice mode.", "whatsNew": "\u2022 Fixed illegible black page titles across dark themes (Tron, Obsidian, and Custom).\n\u2022 Fixed \"Hey Jarvis\" wake-word & Speech-to-Text pipeline so spoken commands execute reliably instead of being discarded, with activation chime, partial-transcript recovery, and automatic offline-to-online STT fallback.\n\u2022 Improved Text-to-Speech reliability using media audio routing, transient audio focus, and completion watchdog.\n\u2022 Added in-app google-services.json import and raw GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON secret supp"}, "pt-BR": {"description": "A.O.Jarvis \u00e9 um assistente pessoal Android com arquitetura local-first que une Gemini Cloud (via Firebase AI Logic), servidor Ollama rodando no seu computador na rede Wi-Fi local e comandos de voz offline.\n\nPrincipais recursos:\n- Reconhecimento de voz nativo do Android (SpeechRecognizer) com suporte offline e resposta falada (TTS).\n- Foreground Service cont\u00ednuo para escuta por palavra de ativa\u00e7\u00e3o e gatilhos autenticados na rede local (Wi-Fi LAN).\n- Altern\u00e2ncia inteligente entre Gemini Cloud, Gemini Live e Ollama local via Wi-Fi.\n- Gerenciamento multi-sess\u00e3o de conversas, mem\u00f3rias locais persistentes e comandos de voz personalizados.\n- Integra\u00e7\u00f5es com aplicativos do dispositivo e auto-navega\u00e7\u00e3o guiada pelo pr\u00f3prio assistente.\n- Verifica\u00e7\u00e3o remota de atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es via GitHub Releases e reposit\u00f3rio F-Droid pessoal.\n", "icon": "icon_VIgUKn9poC4_iuwbCJrhqG6Cm7SeBo78BQMFe3sdGRw=.png", "name": "A.O.Jarvis", "summary": "Assistente de voz Android com Gemini, Ollama local na rede Wi-Fi e modo offline.", "whatsNew": "\u2022 Corre\u00e7\u00e3o do contraste dos t\u00edtulos em todas as p\u00e1ginas nos temas escuros (Tron, Obsidian e Custom).\n\u2022 Corre\u00e7\u00e3o completa da chamada \"Hey Jarvis\" e do Speech-to-Text para executar os comandos falados em vez de descart\u00e1-los, com bip de confirma\u00e7\u00e3o, recupera\u00e7\u00e3o de transcri\u00e7\u00e3o parcial e fallback autom\u00e1tico de STT.\n\u2022 Melhoria na s\u00edntese de voz (TTS) com \u00e1udio em stream de m\u00eddia, foco de \u00e1udio e prote\u00e7\u00e3o contra travamento ao concluir a fala.\n\u2022 Suporte \u00e0 importa\u00e7\u00e3o direta do google-services.json dentro"}}}], "packages": {"com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx": [{"added": 1795835353000, "apkName": "A.O.Jarvis-1.3.3-vc7-05567b77.apk", "hash": "05567b77dfe54a385d92c61d9b6de68787a82b5a24c6159b160beb799b0799af", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "packageName": "com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx", "sig": "ecc44946e982eb126e7a7c8eb5bfe736", "signer": "80d23800367a4cdfc9a18f342d48a5576644de56d7f9521a4c6355c40be1e961", "size": 30962871, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE", null], ["android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_STATE", null], ["android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MICROPHONE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PROJECTION", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["android.permission.REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION", null], ["android.permission.READ_CONTACTS", null], ["android.permission.READ_CALENDAR", null], ["android.permission.WRITE_CALENDAR", null], ["android.permission.CAMERA", null], ["android.permission.BLUETOOTH", 30], ["android.permission.BLUETOOTH_ADMIN", 30], ["android.permission.BLUETOOTH_CONNECT", null], ["com.android.alarm.permission.SET_ALARM", null], ["android.permission.WRITE_SETTINGS", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NOTIFICATION_POLICY", null], ["android.permission.USE_BIOMETRIC", null], ["android.permission.USE_FINGERPRINT", null], ["com.google.android.providers.gsf.permission.READ_GSERVICES", null], ["com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx.DYNAM